 "text": "Hi, how are you doing these days? Autumn is lovely, and there's usually fewer people around. Which your partner prefer, straight to the honeymoon or a whole holiday before? Sure, I'll wait. That's easy. Do you have a backyard you can sit on the stairs in? Nice of your landlord, good spot to watch the world go by. Half an hour roughly. Would you like me to pick up something from the shop, or anything else? Here I am. Did you manage to get out on the stairs? Good idea. A quiet spot without small children. In the cafe, a quiet coffee shop, or still the stairs? Autumn is lovely, and often newer than some weddings. The coffee shop is nice if it' quiet. Whichever you choose, I'll wait for you with full battery and a nice coffee.",
